; A condition answering neither 0 nor 1 runs NEITHER branch and says so.
;
; The diagnostic names the form that refused, not the argument position: it
; reads `binary gate must return 0 or 1, received "…"`. Matching on the word
; "condition" matched the docs rather than the runtime.
; expect: calls 1
; expect: diagnostic binary gate
; expect: absent taken
; expect: absent fallback
(% "Answer with a full sentence about the weather."
   "Answer with exactly the word: taken"
   "Answer with exactly the word: fallback")
